## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- `double smma28_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,28,0,MODE_SMMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double ema100_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,100,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double macd = iMACD(NULL,PERIOD_H1,30,60,30,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- Cross: `smma28_1 > ema100_1 && smma28_2 <= ema100_2` AND macd > 0
- SL: 50 pips; TP: 85 pips
- P3 sweeps: SMMA period (21/28/34), MACD (30,60 vs 12,26), TP (70/85/100 pips)

